        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CTO150SLVSBR, Corteo Wooden Door Pull with End Caps</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Wood Door Pull with End Caps is available in different types of wood including cherry, mahogany, white oak, and black walnut. <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbiw.pdf?v=1704262327\" target=\"new\">Click Here</a> to see them all. This 1-1/2 inch diameter door handle is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. The solid brass brackets and end caps come in a variety of finishes. Choose from surface mounting, thru-bolt mounting, and back-to-back mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions CTO150SLVSBR Corteo Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbiw.pdf?v=1704262327\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CTO150SLVSBR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262230\"><b>First Impressions CTO150SLVSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CTO150018SLVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CTO150024SLVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CTO150036SLVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 27\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
